ying it also into the copy buffer.","type":"text"}]}],"title":"Find"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Issue-Navigator","level":3,"text":"Issue Navigator","type":"heading"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌘5","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"name":"Tip","style":"tip","type":"aside"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode shows build issues in the issue navigator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Double click an issue to open its location in the editor.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the filter bar at the bottom to search for specific issue, filter only errors or issue from recent builds.","type":"text"}]}],"title":"Issue"},{"content":[{"level":3,"anchor":"Test-Navigator","text":"Test Navigator","type":"heading"},{"name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌘6","type":"codeVoice"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The test navigator show all your tests.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can switch between test plans and group the shown tests using their tags."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you hover the mouse pointer over a test class or an individual test, Xcode show a small button that allows to run just these tests."}]}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"test_navigator_hover_button"}]}]}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"}],"title":"Test"},{"content":[{"level":3,"anchor":"Debug-Navigator","type":"heading","text":"Debug Navigator"},{"type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⌘7","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip"},{"type":"paragraph","in